// Two 16th-note patterns, alternating bar by bar. Em and G, per beat: down on 1, down on &, up on a
// ("1 & a"). C and D, per beat: down on the beat (a dotted 8th), up on the a. The hand moves in 16ths throughout.
\title "16th strums on Em, C, G, D"
\tempo 70
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
\staff { tabs }
